    "8c18548f99ab0211abf7"
   ],
   "duration": 13.071,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Now the identical partitioned node runs a real pre-vote round first, before ever raising its own term.",
     "start": 0.15,
     "end": 8.033
    },
    {
     "text": "Does pre-voting genuinely stop the identical disruption this time?",
